---
title: "A greenhouse"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> fine
  fine: fine, 10 to 30 °C
  cold: too cold, under 10 °C
  heating: heater on
  hot: too hot, over 30 °C
  venting: vent open
  fine --> fine: wait an hour
  fine --> cold: night falls
  fine --> hot: sun comes out
  cold --> cold: wait an hour [first hour]
  cold --> cold: shut vent [vent is open]
  cold --> heating: heater on [vent is shut]
  heating --> heating: wait an hour
  heating --> fine: heater off
  heating --> hot: sun comes out
  hot --> hot: wait an hour [first hour]
  hot --> hot: heater off [heater is on]
  hot --> venting: open vent [heater is off]
  venting --> venting: wait an hour
  venting --> fine: shut vent
  venting --> cold: night falls
  venting --> cold: cold wind
